{"pageid": 950, "title": "Phantasmatype", "revid": 2210, "categories": ["Lore", "Monsters", "Phantasmatypes"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/7/74/Phantasmatype.png/revision/latest?cb=20241215001254\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Phantasmatype\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/7/74/Phantasmatype.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241215001254\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"181\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Phantasmatype.png\" data-image-key=\"Phantasmatype.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Phantasmatype.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; border-style:none; background-color:transparent;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"20\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#7B68EE;font-size:40px;font-family:serif;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;padding:10px 10px;\">“\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:4px 10px;\"><i>The most insidious of all monstrum also happens to the Order of St. George's greatest asset in the war against monsterkind, and that is the Phantasmatype.</i>\n</td>\n<td width=\"20\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"color:#7B68EE;font-size:40px;font-family:serif;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;padding:10px 10px;\">”\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\"><div style=\"line-height:1em;text-align: right\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\">&#8212; <a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Butcher_1\" title=\"Book of Butcher 1\"><i>The Book of Butcher</i></a></cite></div><i></i>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><p><b>Phantasmatypes</b> are a breed of <a href=\"/wiki/Monsters\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Monsters\">monster</a> fought by <a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">The Order of St. George</a>. Coming from the fear and grief of death and tragedy, the Phantasmatype is an incredibly dangerous type, but also the ones that form the Order's <a href=\"/wiki/Totem\" title=\"Totem\">sacred totems</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>Little is known about the origins of Phantasmatypes, though they usually come from grief surrounding the recently deceased. Any monster that is made to possess an object becomes a Phantasmatype despite its previous classifications.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOB&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOB-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Phantasmatype is most often known to locale as \"ghosts\" or \"spirits.\" They have fully non-corporeal forms, but hold a material tether that binds them to reality and gives them the ability to hunt and haunt. These tethers must be severed in order to fully destroy the Phantasmatype, usually through breakage or destruction. However, tethers can be anything, such as a house, ancient relic, or living being.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOB&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOB-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Phantasmatypes\">Notable Phantasmatypes</span></h2>\n<p>All <a href=\"/wiki/Totem\" title=\"Totem\">totems</a> are Phantasmatypes, as they are forced into possession in order to be bound to a Hunter. There other other Phantasmatypes, such as:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>TBA</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Phantasmatype-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:184px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Phantasmatype.png\" title=\"Phantasmatype.png (1.48 MB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:184px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/7/74/Phantasmatype.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/184?cb=20241215001254\" title=\"Phantasmatype.png (1.48 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Phantasmatype.png\" data-image-key=\"Phantasmatype.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Phantasmatype.png (1.48 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Phantasmatype.png\" data-image-key=\"Phantasmatype.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/7/74/Phantasmatype.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/184?cb=20241215001254\" /></a></div></div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<small><div style=\"width:auto; max-height:190px; overflow:auto; padding-left:0.5em; padding-right:0.5em; border-top-left-radius:0.5em; border-bottom-left-radius:0.5em\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-BOB-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-BOB_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-BOB_1-1\">1.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">Tynion, James IV</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Butcher_1\" title=\"Book of Butcher 1\">Book of Butcher</a>,</i> vol. #1, <a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Butcher_1\" title=\"Book of Butcher 1\">issue no.1</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>, 2023.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div></small></div>", "fetched_at": "2026-10-28T22:43:33+00:00"}